WEBVTT

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:02.970
...Yuuto-san...Yuuto-san...

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:05.430
please wake up...it's morning...

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:07.320
Uh...mm...

00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:09.820
Good morning, Yuuto-san.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:12.350
Ha-Haruka!

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.180
Wh-what's up?

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:18.650
Breakfast is ready.

00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:20.390
...wait...

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:22.010
is that outfit...!?

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:25.720
Mugah!!

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:28.000
Yu-Yuuto...san...

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:30.340
Ha-Haruka...

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:36.210
Awmm,

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:38.030
Haruka~

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:41.200
Well well, he seems very happy~

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:44.610
I'm very curious as to what kind of dream he's having,

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:46.120
but we have no time.

00:00:46.410 --> 00:00:47.540
You're right,

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:50.310
then let's take the brute force method~

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:51.700
koku koku.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:56.720
Waaaaaaah!!

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:36.460
("...Oh Yes...")

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:34.700
Wh-what's going on!?

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:37.500
Please excuse us.

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:41.920
Today, we have come to invite Yuuto-sama to our year-end party.

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:47.100
(World's Maid and Butler Union)

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:47.100
(Maid & Butler Combined Year-End Party Invitation)

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:43.420
...year-end party?

00:02:43.940 --> 00:02:46.680
World's Maid and Butler Union...?

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:47.580
Is it for me?

00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:49.860
What are you  talking about~

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:53.610
Yuuto-sama is already an excellent butler too~

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:55.860
We're talking about your experience at the Tennouji Family.

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:58.030
Oh, that...

00:02:58.640 --> 00:03:03.870
Since then, Yuuto-sama's name is firmly registered with the Union.

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:06.080
I see...

00:03:06.650 --> 00:03:08.130
So, what would you like to do?

00:03:08.860 --> 00:03:12.340
Well, it's winter break, and I have no other plans...

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:14.530
Uhuhu! We're all set, then.

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:17.920
Then Yuuto-sama, please change into these.

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:20.880
Butler uniform, huh...?

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:30.280
Oh..ah!

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:31.910
Huh...Yeahn!

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:43.110
Huh? Isn't this Haruka's house?

00:03:43.440 --> 00:03:46.790
Yes, we rotate the host and event hall each year,

00:03:47.050 --> 00:03:49.490
and this year, the Nogizaka Family is in charge.

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:56.570
We've been waiting for you, Yuuto-sama.

00:03:56.760 --> 00:03:59.800
Oh, uh, was it Yukinohara...

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:00.970
Maria-san?

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:03.180
Thank you for the other day.

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:06.650
No, I'm glad to see that you're better.

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:12.830
Today, all ranks of the Nogizaka Family Maid Team are invited.

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:14.900
Well then everyone,

00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:16.680
let's introduce ourselves~

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:21.820
Rank No.1, the Maid Leader, Sakurazaka Hazuki!

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:25.100
Rank No. 3, Maid Leader Assistant, Nanashiro Nanami~

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:28.210
Rank No. 5, Medic Team Leader, Yukinohara Maria.

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:31.570
R-rank No. 6, Cook Leader, Nogikawa Koayu.

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:33.340
Rokujou Ayame!

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:33.800
Sara!

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:34.340
Juri!

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:37.260
The three of us together makes Rank No. 7!

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:39.760
We maintain combat planes and do chauffeuring.

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:41.560
Nice to meet you~

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:44.990
Wah!

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:49.170
Rank No. 9, Chemistry Department Manager, Munakata Rio.

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:53.410
Rank No. 10, Festivity Manager, Hinasaki Iwai.

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:57.640
That's the Nogizaka Family Maid Team Top Ten!

00:04:57.720 --> 00:04:59.510
Nice to meet you.

00:05:03.310 --> 00:05:08.750
In addition, there's one more member, Rank No. 4, Kusumoto Minao-chan.

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:10.410
Oh...hm?

00:05:13.810 --> 00:05:15.410
Um, what about Rank No. 2?

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:16.140
Hah!

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:17.240
Oh!

00:05:17.130 --> 00:05:17.660
Hyah!

00:05:17.590 --> 00:05:18.070
Mm!

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:18.660
Huh!?

00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:20.600
Wh-what...!?

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:22.720
...Rank No. 2 is...

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:25.160
currently a missing number...

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:28.000
the reason being...

00:05:27.060 --> 00:05:28.190
Oh...oh...

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:29.950
Would you like to know?

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:31.660
Huh!?

00:05:33.170 --> 00:05:35.600
Would you really like to know...?

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:41.450
Uh, nah, it's okay...

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:43.680
Oh! phew~

00:05:44.020 --> 00:05:46.960
Oh really~ What a relief~

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:49.510
It scared me for a moment there.

00:05:49.790 --> 00:05:50.870
Right~?

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:52.890
Then, let us begin soon.

00:05:53.310 --> 00:05:54.430
Okay~!

00:05:57.690 --> 00:05:59.110
...I'll stay away from that subject...

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:05.800
(95th Maid & Butler Combined Year-End Party)

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:12.990
Wow... it's really only butlers and maids, huh?

00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:14.210
That's right~

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:18.270
also, the maids at the maid-café's are not included,

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:21.920
so everyone here are all professional maids and butlers~

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:23.130
Hm?

00:06:22.680 --> 00:06:23.200
Huh?

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:25.990
Ah. Ah. Test, test.

00:06:26.230 --> 00:06:28.430
Douglas is handsome again today.

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:31.030
The Douglas next door is a massive persimmon eating Douglas.

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:33.190
One-two-three-four, hey-hey,

00:06:33.480 --> 00:06:35.190
huh-huh, check-check.

00:06:35.190 --> 00:06:36.740
Uh, Hazuki-san?

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:39.920
Could it be that I'm already on-air?

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:41.240
Yes~

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:43.220
Oh no, please excuse...!!

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:55.140
We'd now like to begin the 59th Maid & Butler Combined Year-End Party!

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:56.390
Cheers!

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:58.570
Cheers!

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:06.180
I've avenged you, Miruka-san.

00:07:06.180 --> 00:07:07.360
Haruna-sama...

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:09.070
Onee-sama!

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:12.900
Aww...Haruna-sama, working hard for her friend...

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:15.620
Friendship is...so beautiful...

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:19.040
("Smile Interview-Asakura Nobunaga Interview...)

00:07:19.590 --> 00:07:21.550
hm...so bored~

00:07:21.690 --> 00:07:24.380
I wanted to attend the year-end party too~

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:25.200
But...

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:28.960
It's a party that only maids and butlers can attend.

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:31.120
I know that, but~

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:33.560
Onee-chan, don't you want to go too?

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:35.420
The year-end party with Onii-san?

00:07:35.540 --> 00:07:37.590
Uh, well...

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:43.370
if it's possible, I want to...but I mean...

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:44.230
(You're making excuses!)

00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:47.670
Well then Yuuto-sama,

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:50.720
I must go soon, so~

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:51.450
What?

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:55.830
This party is being run by the Nogizaka Family Maid Team,

00:07:56.010 --> 00:07:58.690
so there are different things for us to do~

00:07:58.920 --> 00:07:59.890
I see...

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:00.970
Okay, Alice-chan,

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:01.580
Huh?

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:03.260
it's all you now.

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:04.810
Huh? Uh, um.

00:08:07.780 --> 00:08:09.850
Since we're here, wanna get something to eat?

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:10.460
koku

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:12.340
Okay, hold on a second.

00:08:16.460 --> 00:08:18.800
Huh...? A-Alice is gonna go?

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:20.160
koku koku koku

00:08:20.510 --> 00:08:22.930
Th-then I guess I'll wait here.

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:23.880
tehe!

00:08:26.030 --> 00:08:27.340
Will she be okay...?

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:31.550
I thought Alice is in charge of V.I.P. protection and fighting...

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:32.790
Ah!

00:08:45.060 --> 00:08:46.400
Aww...

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:49.410
Oh, uhh, it's okay. Don't worry about it.

00:08:50.320 --> 00:08:51.070
Thanks.

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:53.100
ehe

00:08:53.270 --> 00:08:55.590
Oh, Ayase-dono! I didn't know you were here!

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:56.830
Mudou-san!

00:08:57.200 --> 00:08:58.950
It's very nice to see you again. I'm glad to see that you are doing well.

00:08:59.270 --> 00:09:04.220
Since then, Touka-ojousama has become slightly more kind,

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:07.010
and she laughs very happily from time to time.

00:09:07.260 --> 00:09:08.190
Touka does?

00:09:12.600 --> 00:09:13.670
Hmm...

00:09:14.260 --> 00:09:15.450
Oh? Who is this here?

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:19.350
Oh, she's a Nogizaka Family's maid and...

00:09:20.470 --> 00:09:22.700
Oh, is she the Nogizaka's?

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:24.970
Hmph, that's wonderful.

00:09:25.030 --> 00:09:26.660
I want to meet her.

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:29.730
Wow, what a cute ribbon.

00:09:29.910 --> 00:09:34.060
What do you think are the required qualities of good butlers?

00:09:34.060 --> 00:09:39.850
I'm thoroughly impressed that you are a part of the glorious Nogizaka Family Maid Team at this young age!

00:09:40.490 --> 00:09:41.180
Alice!

00:09:41.610 --> 00:09:43.700
Is something wrong, Alice?

00:09:49.410 --> 00:09:53.780
Everyone, did Alice do anything to trouble you?

00:09:54.180 --> 00:10:00.630
If anything of that sort happened, I apologize as a representative of the Nogizaka Family Maid Team.

00:10:02.390 --> 00:10:03.840
I'm sorry.

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:07.060
N-no, there's no trouble...

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:10.030
W-we were just having a little conversation...

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:13.370
I see, I'm glad to hear that.

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:20.660
Hm. Kusumoto Minamo-dono is truly impressive, what great authority!

00:10:20.830 --> 00:10:23.010
She silenced the whole crowd at once.

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:24.820
Huh? Do you know her?

00:10:25.150 --> 00:10:26.140
Of course.

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:29.100
At rank No. 4, she is the head of the Maid Chamberlain,

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:35.000
takes care of finances, law, and public relations, and at times necessary, is able to act as a Maid Team Leader Substitute.

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:38.450
She is the most exemplary maid ever!

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:41.500
I see, that person is the rank No. 4...

00:10:44.760 --> 00:10:46.590
Alice, are you okay?

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:47.520
Uhm...

00:10:47.990 --> 00:10:50.130
Since you're still not fluent in Japanese,

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:54.320
I thought I told you not to be alone.

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:54.200
Oh...

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:57.950
Ayase-sama, I apologize for your inconvenience.

00:10:58.200 --> 00:11:00.210
N-no, I wasn't really...

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:02.300
I believe we have not met.

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:05.350
I'm Kusumoto Minamo.

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:07.060
Nice to meet you.

00:11:07.440 --> 00:11:09.790
Oh, y-yes, you too.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:13.080
Wh-what is it?

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:14.470
Nothing...

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:16.500
please excuse me.

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:24.510
Oh man, she makes me more nervous than Gentou-san...

00:11:25.020 --> 00:11:25.320
Oh...

00:11:25.760 --> 00:11:26.140
mm...

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:36.380
Geez,

00:11:36.850 --> 00:11:43.360
why do I have to attend these servants' inferior party!

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:47.410
Koku!

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:54.160
We're the Nogizaka Family Maid Team!

00:11:55.340 --> 00:11:56.100
Okay then!

00:11:56.470 --> 00:11:59.660
We'll now begin the fun-filled Bingo Contest~!

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:04.450
We've prepared lots of prizes, so have fun~!

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:09.230
Oh! That is "Suihan Kakumei-Nice Rice"!

00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:15.510
It uses infrared rays that cooks rice 1.5 times better than usual.

00:12:17.730 --> 00:12:18.860
Hmm...oh!

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:22.500
W-what's wrong, Alice?

00:12:24.940 --> 00:12:25.520
Huh...

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:28.050
Gelorian-X...

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:30.490
Wait, do you want that?

00:12:30.900 --> 00:12:32.400
koku koku koku koku koku!

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:34.110
Okay, let's begin!

00:12:32.800 --> 00:12:33.380
Huh!

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:36.180
The first number is...

00:12:39.170 --> 00:12:40.230
How was that?

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:42.980
Ooh! How are you doing, Alice?

00:12:46.520 --> 00:12:48.460
Okay, the next number is...

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:52.100
Number 38~!

00:12:52.320 --> 00:12:53.310
ah...

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:53.780
Bingo~!!

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:54.290
Bingo!

00:12:55.430 --> 00:12:58.660
Okay, everyone, congratulations~!

00:12:59.400 --> 00:13:01.910
The prizes are going away quickly.

00:13:02.270 --> 00:13:05.700
L-look, the Geloriann-X is still there...

00:13:06.350 --> 00:13:07.220
huh?

00:13:07.900 --> 00:13:11.600
Okay, here we go, it's number 25!

00:13:12.510 --> 00:13:13.890
Bingo, bingo~!!

00:13:13.700 --> 00:13:14.790
Bingo!

00:13:15.870 --> 00:13:17.310
A-Alice...

00:13:19.930 --> 00:13:20.420
Hm?

00:13:23.620 --> 00:13:25.560
Okay then, the next number is...

00:13:26.650 --> 00:13:27.930
44!

00:13:28.220 --> 00:13:29.690
It's number 44~!

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:30.430
Oh!

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:32.340
Bingo~!!

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:34.970
Nice-Rice!

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:38.800
Oh...Hmm...

00:13:42.510 --> 00:13:43.220
Alice...

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:47.560
pyon pyon

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:49.590
pyon pyon!

00:13:48.960 --> 00:13:50.950
Alice, be careful~

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:51.300
pyon pyon...

00:13:52.410 --> 00:13:53.750
Was that really okay with you?

00:13:53.840 --> 00:13:54.210
Huh?

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:58.210
Didn't you have another prize that you wanted?

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:00.540
Oh, well, I guess so, but...

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:02.380
pyon! pyon!

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:03.570
This is fine with me.

00:14:05.010 --> 00:14:06.010
Yup, yup.

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:08.750
Thank you very much.

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:09.170
Huh?

00:14:09.830 --> 00:14:11.620
Oh, no, um...

00:14:15.760 --> 00:14:16.140
Hmph!

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:21.000
I thought I smelled the stench of the poor, and here you are!

00:14:21.130 --> 00:14:21.370
Huh?

00:14:22.260 --> 00:14:24.540
It's been a while, you poor douche.

00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:28.090
I didn't think I'd see you at a place like this.

00:14:29.650 --> 00:14:30.190
Hm?

00:14:31.380 --> 00:14:32.520
...who are you?

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:36.510
Y-you mean to say that you forgot my face!?

00:14:36.940 --> 00:14:37.460
Shuuto!!

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:39.740
It's Shuuto Southerland!

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:42.650
Shuuto...

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:48.530
Oh...from that time...

00:14:50.100 --> 00:14:52.560
So, why are you here?

00:14:53.380 --> 00:14:55.830
Out of all people, you'd say that!?

00:14:55.900 --> 00:14:57.810
It's all your fault!

00:14:57.810 --> 00:14:58.290
Ah!

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:02.970
P-please calm down. You're Secret-Shoes' heel will break!

00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:04.300
Th-that's right.

00:15:04.350 --> 00:15:07.080
There's no need to tell him that after that birthday party, you angered your father and was told,

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:12.770
"A fool like you should lower yourself to a butler once and be re-educated!"

00:15:12.770 --> 00:15:14.890
You look good in a butler outfit too!

00:15:14.980 --> 00:15:16.220
Gaaaah!!!

00:15:17.760 --> 00:15:19.930
I see, that's what happened...

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:22.160
h-hmph!

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:23.430
Well, it doesn't matter.

00:15:23.780 --> 00:15:26.380
This stupid lifestyle will end very soon.

00:15:27.160 --> 00:15:32.820
Today, I'll just amuse myself by looking at your guys' stinking poor faces, hahaha!

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:34.590
Hahahahahaha

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:35.710
huni huni...

00:15:38.140 --> 00:15:39.120
Oh! Alice!

00:15:39.680 --> 00:15:40.190
Huh?

00:15:40.380 --> 00:15:41.040
Ah!

00:15:42.570 --> 00:15:43.250
OUCH!

00:15:43.530 --> 00:15:45.530
What are you doing, you brat!

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:47.030
Watch where you're going!!

00:15:47.350 --> 00:15:47.700
hah...

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:51.440
How much do you think this special-order butler outfit cost!?

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:56.000
Oh...uh...

00:15:57.250 --> 00:15:58.730
ah...uh...

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:06.320
Geez! What are you doing?

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:07.860
You useless kid!

00:16:08.520 --> 00:16:09.710
Just move out of the way now!

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:10.020
Itete!

00:16:11.870 --> 00:16:13.590
Huh? What is this?

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:18.230
You bump into a noble man like me because you're carrying something creepy like this!

00:16:18.550 --> 00:16:19.020
Ah!

00:16:38.990 --> 00:16:41.010
H-huh? What do you want!?

00:16:41.460 --> 00:16:45.520
You stupid butlers and maids have something to say to me or something!?

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:48.160
I'm different from you guys!

00:16:48.390 --> 00:16:51.100
I'm the heir to the famous Southerland Group!

00:16:51.580 --> 00:16:54.880
I'm at the same rank as your masters!

00:16:55.390 --> 00:16:57.850
We live in a different world from the first place!

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:04.700
Alice, are you okay?

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:09.060
You've gone too far against one little girl!

00:17:09.410 --> 00:17:10.470
What did you say...?

00:17:11.770 --> 00:17:14.860
Then why don't you get on your knees and apologize!

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:15.510
huh...!

00:17:16.040 --> 00:17:17.910
Here, do it now.

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:22.400
I'll make you suffer the exact same shame that I experienced last time.

00:17:32.140 --> 00:17:32.770
Ah!

00:17:39.890 --> 00:17:41.390
Hahahaha!

00:17:41.390 --> 00:17:43.600
He really did it!

00:17:43.690 --> 00:17:45.470
Hah! What a fool!

00:17:54.310 --> 00:17:56.050
But it's so ridiculous.

00:17:56.450 --> 00:18:00.060
I can't believe you would go so far for just a servant.

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:04.180
Aren't they just like useful cleaning machines?

00:18:04.440 --> 00:18:06.050
What is he saying...?

00:18:06.050 --> 00:18:07.350
How cruel...

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:11.390
Maybe you don't understand,

00:18:12.030 --> 00:18:15.130
but to me, Alice isn't just a servant!

00:18:15.580 --> 00:18:16.310
H-huh?

00:18:16.760 --> 00:18:18.070
It's not just Alice.

00:18:18.350 --> 00:18:19.650
I feel the same way about Hazuki-san, Nanami-san,

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:21.590
and everyone else here!

00:18:22.100 --> 00:18:26.110
They are all kind, warm, and are always thinking what's best for us!

00:18:27.050 --> 00:18:29.110
They are all irreplaceable, valuable people!

00:18:29.360 --> 00:18:30.360
Oh...

00:18:29.360 --> 00:18:30.530
Oh...

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:34.160
What's wrong with acting for the good for those valuable people!?

00:18:34.570 --> 00:18:38.320
How could you call yourself a master without even knowing that!

00:18:38.710 --> 00:18:39.300
What...

00:18:40.030 --> 00:18:41.250
sh-shut up!!

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:43.400
You're just a poor commoner...

00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:44.890
Hey, you guys!

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:46.310
Get rid of him!!

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:48.860
hehehehe...

00:18:48.860 --> 00:18:50.730
Okay, that's enough~

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:52.250
Yuuto-sama,

00:18:52.640 --> 00:18:55.610
thank you for your kindhearted words.

00:18:55.610 --> 00:18:57.030
We're here to help.

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:02.860
Y-you guys! Go already!

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:04.100
B-but...!!

00:19:04.820 --> 00:19:07.180
We can't fight against all the Nogizaka Family Maid Team...

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:09.160
Damn! You guys are worthless!

00:19:09.350 --> 00:19:10.950
Never mind! I'll take care of it!

00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:16.370
Well~

00:19:16.680 --> 00:19:19.830
It's not right for you to be violent towards the ladies~

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:21.380
It's bad manners.

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:26.240
Ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh...

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:28.510
This is for all the anger of the maids and butlers who were insulted by you, and...

00:19:28.670 --> 00:19:29.670
For Alice-chan...

00:19:29.760 --> 00:19:34.290
along with Yuuto-sama, who've been so kind to us, but whom you've terribly mistreated...

00:19:35.760 --> 00:19:36.600
Punishment!

00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:38.040
Ahh!

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:40.150
Oigh!

00:19:40.730 --> 00:19:43.330
m-my beautiful face...!!

00:19:43.890 --> 00:19:45.450
Y-you fools...

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:48.200
you think you can get away with this...

00:19:48.240 --> 00:19:49.270
Southerland-sama,

00:19:49.730 --> 00:19:51.560
there's a phone call from your father.

00:19:51.610 --> 00:19:52.170
What?

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:54.060
Hello? Papan!?

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:55.970
You complete fool!!!!

00:19:56.330 --> 00:19:57.370
Pa!? Papan...??

00:19:57.530 --> 00:19:58.450
I heard all about it.

00:19:58.870 --> 00:20:00.930
I can't believe you...

00:20:01.330 --> 00:20:05.780
I thought you were able to understand feelings of others by now, but I guess I was wrong!!

00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:08.400
What? B-but this is...

00:20:07.870 --> 00:20:08.690
Shut up!!!!

00:20:09.790 --> 00:20:13.420
Anyways, all the guests at the party and the Nogizaka Family...

00:20:13.760 --> 00:20:15.910
My idiotic son has been such a disturbance...

00:20:16.100 --> 00:20:17.720
I sincerely apologize...

00:20:18.040 --> 00:20:22.880
I'll leave everything up to you to give him a grave punishment!

00:20:23.750 --> 00:20:24.730
Well then, excuse me.

00:20:26.020 --> 00:20:27.270
Pa-Papan...

00:20:27.440 --> 00:20:28.370
No way.

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:30.550
Oh...

00:20:31.490 --> 00:20:35.190
Muuuu...!!

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:33.810
ah...

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:39.340
Ahh!!!

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:42.620
Alice, are you okay?

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:43.480
hwah!

00:20:44.040 --> 00:20:45.680
That was such a nightmare.

00:20:46.630 --> 00:20:48.340
Your Gelorian is ruined too...

00:20:48.730 --> 00:20:51.300
If there's a spare one, do you want to exchange it for a new one?

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:54.070
Hazuki-sa...?

00:20:56.540 --> 00:20:58.700
What? Why don't we just ask...?

00:21:00.240 --> 00:21:02.490
I...like...this...

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:03.240
What?

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:05.920
Yuuto-sama...

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:07.760
gave me...

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:09.890
this...I like...

00:21:10.390 --> 00:21:11.010
Alice...

00:21:11.560 --> 00:21:12.270
you're speaking Japanese...

00:21:13.180 --> 00:21:14.260
Well well~

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:18.440
It's pretty amazing that you made Alice-chan speak, Yuuto-sama.

00:21:18.900 --> 00:21:24.310
It's very rare for shy Alice-chan to speak up out of her own will.

00:21:24.610 --> 00:21:24.920
Eh...

00:21:25.210 --> 00:21:25.880
Oh... ?

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:29.490
It even took us about half a year for her to start talking to us.

00:21:29.490 --> 00:21:29.970
teehee...

00:21:33.450 --> 00:21:34.460
Bruder...

00:21:37.540 --> 00:21:38.430
Yuuto-sama,

00:21:38.810 --> 00:21:40.750
thank you about what you did earlier.

00:21:41.600 --> 00:21:42.580
What you said...

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:46.700
Yuuto-sama's true feelings, made me truly happy...

00:21:47.280 --> 00:21:48.760
Thank you very much.

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:52.060
Bravo!

00:21:52.440 --> 00:21:53.810
Korosho!

00:21:54.390 --> 00:21:55.870
Mamamia!!!

00:21:58.630 --> 00:22:00.400
Oh man...geez...

00:22:01.530 --> 00:22:06.010
With this in mind, we'll work as hard as we can from now on as well.

00:22:06.450 --> 00:22:09.860
We, too, care very much about Yuuto-sama...

00:22:10.060 --> 00:22:13.870
No, it's more like we all very much love you, so...!

00:22:14.310 --> 00:22:15.400
We're in love.

00:22:15.940 --> 00:22:17.950
koku koku koku koku koku!

00:22:18.560 --> 00:22:19.300
Teehee...

00:22:19.990 --> 00:22:22.170
Huh, uh, um...

00:22:22.470 --> 00:22:23.320
Hehe,

00:22:23.390 --> 00:22:25.610
Haruka-sama, I'm sorry~

00:22:25.930 --> 00:22:28.340
Just for now, we'll borrow Yuuto-sama...

00:22:30.060 --> 00:22:31.440
Yuuto...sama...

00:22:31.580 --> 00:22:33.930
Uh..ha...hahaha...

00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:39.130
A-achoo!!

00:22:39.920 --> 00:22:41.710
Hm.. huh...?

00:22:42.070 --> 00:22:42.990
Hm?

00:24:14.800 --> 00:24:18.020
(Nogizaka Vocabulary Fundamentals)

00:24:15.960 --> 00:24:17.630
Nogizaka Vocabulary Fundamentals!

00:24:17.700 --> 00:24:18.830
This week, it's "Miko-san"!

00:24:18.020 --> 00:24:27.610
(Miko)

00:24:18.880 --> 00:24:22.040
It's a religious term from Shinto: a woman who serves god.

00:24:22.140 --> 00:24:24.210
Yuuto-san, do you like Miko-san?

00:24:24.250 --> 00:24:25.700
Uh, I guess?

00:24:25.850 --> 00:24:27.720
Then, what about Hatano-san?

00:24:27.610 --> 00:24:34.780
(Next: "My body is burning up...")

00:24:27.810 --> 00:24:31.700
I'm all for acting, so I don't really care for things like that,

00:24:31.760 --> 00:24:32.910
haha!

00:24:32.910 --> 00:24:34.240
No! Don't erase me!

00:24:34.780 --> 00:24:40.400
(See you next week)

00:24:34.780 --> 00:24:40.400
(Nogizaka Haruka no Himitsu Purezza)
